{"metadata":{"title":"Getting started","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, give the wallet its keys, its storage and a Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provider, and create it at launch."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/gettingstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":" needs four things from your app: its configuration, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" for its keys, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":" for what it holds, and a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","isActive":true},{"text":" that attests it to issuers. The package has standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores for the first two; the Wallet Provider is your backend.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Add-the-package","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Add the package"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add OID4VCWallet to your app with Swift Package Manager, from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift"},{"text":". In ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":[".package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo-wallet-swift\", from: \"0.8.0\")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links a binary framework, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":", which SwiftPM checks","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against the checksum in the package’s manifest.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Register-the-wallet","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Register the wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers’ Authorization Servers know the wallet as an OAuth client: a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"client ID, and a redirect URI the app opens when the holder returns from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the issuer’s pages. Register a private-use URI scheme for it, in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app’s Info.plist (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CFBundleURLTypes"},{"text":"), and pass the URL the app receives","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the issuance.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wallet trusts only what chains to the roots you give it, as PEM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"certificates: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRoots"},{"text":" for credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifierRoots"},{"text":" for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the Verifiers it answers. A Credential Offer’s issuer isn’t trusted just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"because it sent the offer.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Provide-the-keys-and-the-storage","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Provide the keys and the storage"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps every key in the Secure Enclave. A holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key — the one a credential is bound to — signs only when presenting, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by default asks for Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode first: add an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":" to the app’s Info.plist, or iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","isActive":true},{"text":" keeps each credential as a file with complete","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data protection, out of backups: a credential is useless without its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder key, which can’t leave this device. An app with a document","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"provider extension keeps both in places the extension can read too; see","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore\/inAppGroup(_:options:)","isActive":true},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderAccessGroup","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Implement-the-Wallet-Provider","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implement the Wallet Provider"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Issuers following HAIP accept only a wallet its Wallet Provider has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attested: a Wallet Attestation for the wallet’s instance key, and a Key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Attestation for the keys a credential will be bound to. Your backend","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issues them; the app passes the keys and returns its answers. A real","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Wallet Provider attests only after checking App Attest evidence that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s talking to your genuine app.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Asks the app's backend for attestations. The keys are public JWKs,","\/\/\/ as JSON; the answers are compact JWTs.","struct BackendWalletProvider: WalletProvider {","    let backend: URL","","    func walletAttestation(clientID: String, instanceKey: Data) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"wallet-attestation\", [","            \"client_id\": clientID,","            \"instance_key\": try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: instanceKey),","        ])","    }","","    func keyAttestation(keys: [Data], nonce: String) async throws -> String {","        try await post(\"key-attestation\", [","            \"keys\": try keys.map { try JSONSerialization.jsonObject(with: $0) },","            \"nonce\": nonce,","        ])","    }","","    private func post(_ path: String, _ body: [String: Any]) async throws -> String {","        var request = URLRequest(url: backend.appending(path: path))","        request.httpMethod = \"POST\"","        request.setValue(\"application\/json\", forHTTPHeaderField: \"Content-Type\")","        request.httpBody = try JSONSerialization.data(withJSONObject: body)","        let (data, response) = try await URLSession.shared.data(for: request)","        guard (response as? HTTPURLResponse)?.statusCode == 200 else { throw URLError(.badServerResponse) }","        return String(decoding: data, as: UTF8.self)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError"},{"text":" the provider throws reaches the wallet as a retryable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/network","isActive":true},{"text":" error; any other is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Create-the-wallet","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Create the wallet"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create one ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","isActive":true},{"text":" when the app starts, and keep it. Creating it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"makes no network requests. At launch, before anything else, sweep the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Keychain of keys no credential uses: an issuance the app quit in the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"middle of leaves its keys behind.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ The app's wallet, created once at launch.","@MainActor","final class AppWallet {","    let wallet: Wallet","    private let keys: KeychainKeyStore","","    init(clientID: String, redirectURI: String, issuerRoots: String, verifierRoots: String, provider: URL) throws {","        let configuration = WalletConfiguration(","            clientID: clientID,","            redirectURI: redirectURI,","            issuerRoots: issuerRoots,","            verifierRoots: verifierRoots)","        keys = KeychainKeyStore()","        wallet = try Wallet(","            configuration: configuration,","            keyStore: keys,","            credentialStore: try FileCredentialStore.standard(),","            provider: BackendWalletProvider(backend: provider))","    }","","    \/\/\/ Run once at launch, before any issuance.","    func start() async throws {","        try await wallet.sweepOrphanedKeys(in: keys)","    }","}"]},{"anchor":"Ship-the-release-build","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Ship the release build"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The package links the release build of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"text":". OID4VCgo’s own tests","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use a test build with an in-process issuer and Verifier that a shipped","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app must never have; ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","isActive":true},{"text":" says which one an app has,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so it can refuse to run on the test build.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Next steps"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingToSafari"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction"}]}]}]}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/HandlingErrors","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GoingToProduction","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"],"generated":true,"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials"}],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/platform":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/platform","title":"platform","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A key store, credential store or Wallet Provider call failed; its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"message follows.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"platform"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV","text":"WalletError"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet11WalletErrorV4CodeV","text":"Code"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/platform","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider","title":"WalletProvider","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The Wallet Provider’s backend, which attests the wallet and its keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(HAIP 1.0 §4.4.1, §4.5.1). Keys are public JWKs, as JSON; the results","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are compact JWTs. A real one attests only after checking platform","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"evidence (App Attest) that it’s talking to the genuine app.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletprovider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/OID4VC/isTestBuild":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether the linked framework is the test build, carrying an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in-process test issuer and Verifier ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-tags mobiletest"},{"type":"text","text":"): an app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should refuse to run on it."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/OID4VC\/isTestBuild","kind":"symbol","title":"isTestBuild","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isTestBuild"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/oid4vc\/istestbuild"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeyStore":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore","title":"KeyStore","role":"symbol","abst